"originalCharacterName":"桜庭 美咲","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく楽天的で、ドジっ子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やや夢見がちな所がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法少女になるのが夢で、憧れの魔法少女になれた事に浮かれて戦い始めるがやがて使命の重さに気づき、魔法少女としての自覚を身につけていく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26","sourceWorkId":"2964","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一作目「魔法天使ミサキ」の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法少女に憧れる明るい娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"デスパイアとの戦いで心身共に成長したが、持ち前の明るさは相変わらず。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"デスパイアとの戦いよりも平和な日常を望んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回は新たなるデスパイアとの対決に加え、恋人（？）章を巡る恋のさや当てにも翻弄される。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26","sourceWorkId":"6078","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一作目「魔法天使ミサキ」の主人公。魔法少女に憧れる明るい女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回は新たなるデスパイアとの対決に加え、章を巡る恋のさや当てに翻弄される。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63238"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/467690f012dc98856b236e1b094f170c7c0c5540a62b1ae8267bc7db8a40ca65.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f6a165625c0e83c656912b589768a7e02895710bd1cfa9984ac9c95028970625.webp","width":256,"height":246,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林眞紀","creatorId":"vndb:s279","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s279","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s279","name":"小林 眞紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:245135:63238:5906:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c46129","characterName":"イクシードエンジェル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"63195","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"245133"},{"characterId":"63195","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"245135"}],"egsCharacterIds":["29"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46129"},"originalCharacterName":"イクシードエンジェル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来魔法少女としてこの世界に来た女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"責任感が強く、説教癖がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美咲達の前では大人っぽく演じようとするが、たまに仮面がはがれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"29","sourceWorkId":"2964","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"前作に登場している真性魔法少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今までに登場しているエンジェルの中では最強。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"心配性なのにドジっ娘という困った少女。胸の薄さがが現在の悩み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"デスパイアと戦う為に訓練されてきた為、「平和な世界を取り戻す」目的で戦っていたにも関わらず、戦いのない日常に居心地の悪さを感じている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"向こうの世界出身で、デスパイアと戦うことが目的のエンジェルとしての立場を持つ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"29","sourceWorkId":"6078","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来魔法少女としてこの世界に来た女の子。責任感が強く、説教癖がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美咲達の前では大人っぽく演じようとするが、たまに仮面がはがれる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63195"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e180f0c5b19644e7ddc0efa15f0da400d43b35283c58c7e606bda129ce784417.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/410632454f3d25e6bb350d7f6f7e98d8c0044ed07b5d7ddaf08f0ecad5d869fd.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"壱智村小真","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:245135:63195:4830:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c46130","characterName":"椚 愛奈","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"206378","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"245135"}],"egsCharacterIds":["30"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46130"},"originalCharacterName":"椚 愛奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛奈がダーククリスタルを手に変身した姿。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女が何故変身するようになったのかは不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミント達と同じくデスパイアを倒すという目的を持っているようだが、ミント達と協力することはない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"逆にお互いが反目し合い、戦いになる場面も。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"30","sourceWorkId":"6078","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛奈が変身した近接戦闘型エンジェル。通常攻撃自体がデスパイアを滅ぼす高破壊力を持つ。デスパイアを倒すために暗躍するが、何故かミント達の前にも立ちふさがる……。武器はｴﾎﾞﾆｰﾘｳﾞｪﾝｼﾞｬｰ。必殺技はﾌﾞﾚｲｸｽﾊﾟｲﾗﾙ。(cv 未来羽)"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"206378"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d6f1ee6397594ed710d8ab4860ccc622aa43bc2702360f437ca7aa3952828d83.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/0492746799216674e012dc477b37addc7a5d141fa1d4e35b83d101eeb06e51eb.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井浩美","creatorId":"vndb:s449","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s449","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s449","name":"櫻井 浩美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:245135:206378:4956:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c46131","characterName":"柊 セツナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"206374","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"245135"}],"egsCharacterIds":["31"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46131"},"originalCharacterName":"柊 セツナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミントよりも先にこの世界に来ていたエンジェル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"行方不明とされていたが、今再びミント達の前に姿を現す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女がなぜ今になって現れたのかは不明。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、ミントの先輩にあたるエンジェルとして、ミントに強い影響力を与えることは間違いないだろう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喫茶店「アンティーク」のマスターと関係があるらしい？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"31","sourceWorkId":"6078","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"断罪の名を冠するエンジェル。エンジェルの中でも最強クラスの破壊力を持つ。深紅の衣装から放たれる氷の如き冷徹な一撃の前に、立ち上がるデスパイアはいない。 武器はヴァニシングスタッフ。 必殺技はｽﾍﾟﾙ･ｵﾌﾞ･ｱｲｼｸﾙｴｯｼﾞ。(cv 桃井いちご)"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"206374"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/6029912b01e07c82a03a5fb4f405674967db2ebbd78208027be99e5dde129dc6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b8d1ae8254e8d2e39138c3380252abc76b1b8f7124bd28c13dd3d84d5378b6b1.webp","width":209,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大久保藍子","creatorId":"vndb:s361","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s361","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s361","name":"大久保 藍子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:245135:206374:5075:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c46132","characterName":"椚 佑奈","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c46132"},"originalCharacterName":"椚 佑奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/eed1ee5a9aaad7eacd5aa89062e0fb88162a1f4f255f69dda39cb9a02ca3ff16.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3b/3b